&"1_1": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "The woman you see in front of you is familiar. 
You realize you know her, though you don’t remember how. ",
"offset": Vector2(229.51501, 168.66),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_2",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(339.9995, 576),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_10": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Once again, you gaze upon the mysteriously familiar figure whom  you know as Kouya.",
"offset": Vector2(160, 1840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_11",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(340.00018, 399.9994),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_11": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Kouya has, of course, assisted many of the famous and wealthy in their courting rituals. All the while, he dreamt of someone one day preparing these rituals for him.",
"offset": Vector2(560, 1840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_12",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(359.99936, 399.9994),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_12": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "These dreams in mind, he performed his ceremonial duties with gusto. And if any mistakes were made in the process, [color=red] his temper could be a sight to behold.[/color]",
"offset": Vector2(980, 1840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(360.00003, 379.9994),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_13": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "You look upon the familiar painting of Yono.",
"offset": Vector2(160, 2380),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_14",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(360.00018, 439.99988),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_14": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "She found herself promised to Yoroi, the son of a wealthy merchant family. She knew of the potential boons this joining would bring to her family, but in her heart was grappling with feelings for another...",
"offset": Vector2(580, 2380),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_15",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(339.99985, 459.99988),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_15": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Moreover, she found herself increasingly terrified of Yoroi's drunken, violent outbursts. This was her house -- she knew how to make herself scarce. [color=\"yellow\"] She would hide in waiting until Yoroi drank himself unconscious. [/color]",
"offset": Vector2(1020, 2380),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(359.9998, 459.99988),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_16": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "You look upon the snarling visage of the man you know as Yoroi.",
"offset": Vector2(120, 2860),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_17",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(400.00006, 379.99982),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_17": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Simple things could trigger his red-hot anger... so his wrath at being denied a blessing for his marriage-to-be was unimaginable.",
"offset": Vector2(580, 2860),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_18",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(319.99997, 379.99982),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_18": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "In his rages, he [color=\"red\"]incurs his wrath upon any he lays eyes on[/color], all the while[color=\"yellow\"] fueling his fire with any alcohol within reach. [/color]",
"offset": Vector2(980, 2860),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(419.99954, 399.99982),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_19": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "The man you see in front of you is familiar. You don't recall why, but the sight of his face fills you with dread.",
"offset": Vector2(200, 3320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_22",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(459.99985, 460.00037),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_2": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "She is Yono, the daughter of a wealthy family. 
It is well known that Yono is very modest, and is uncomfortable being looked at. ",
"offset": Vector2(600, 180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_3",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00015, 575.99976),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_20": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "[color=\"red\"]He's here, now, and he's looking for you. [/color]",
"offset": Vector2(1000, 3320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_21",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(360.00015, 440),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_21": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "[color=\"red\"]You should run.[/color]",
"offset": Vector2(1380, 3360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 268),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_22": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "His name is Yoroi. Son of a wealthy merchant family. Yono's promised husband.",
"offset": Vector2(680, 3320),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_20",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00003, 460),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_3": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Sometimes, [color=red]it can make her very upset…[/color]",
"offset": Vector2(940, 180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(360.0004, 575.99976),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_4": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "The man you see in front of you is someone you’ve seen before and know, though you can’t recall how. 
He is Kouya, a servant of Yono’s family.",
"offset": Vector2(180, 660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(379.99954, 576.0005),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_5": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Kouya wants to make sure all is right with the house, and wants you to make sure you see that he is there to look after things.",
"offset": Vector2(600, 660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_6",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00015, 576.0005),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_6": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "In fact, if you look away for too long, [color=red]he can become extremely frustrated…[/color]
",
"offset": Vector2(940, 660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(340.0004, 576.0005),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_7": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Once again, you gaze upon the mysteriously familiar figure whom  you know as Yono.",
"offset": Vector2(160, 1360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_8",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(340.00018, 420),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_8": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Coming from a family out of fits prime but still desparate for status and wealth, she knew it was a matter of time before she was married off.",
"offset": Vector2(560, 1360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_9",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(359.9996, 420),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_9": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "So why, then, did she have to fall in love with the wrong person...?",
"offset": Vector2(980, 1380),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(340.00027, 420),
"speaker": ""
}
}
